u had to accept Dao Ma's help. It looks like Shu's destination is also Chang'an where he is to be returning a fugitive to his master.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mhFzWaMvfRaa4aSuZ9ogTEtXr96.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"419618","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"110014","synopsis":"The heads of the great five families are summoned by Pei Suji, by the imperial order. Lao Ma is against what the secretary of the emperor offers and he has to pay gravely for that.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/d1JpcEV2dZqV535GnXevr8boJbs.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"419618","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"110111","synopsis":"Lao Mo is dead and Yuji encounters Ayuya in the middle of the road to make her his bride. Dao Ma is beside himself with rage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c1a23RER2kxVhd13yKJf6DdBsHF.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"419618","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"110156","synopsis":"Shu gets involved in Dao Ma's revenge battle. The heads of five families which has now become four are on the road for the blood of Zhi Shilang.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iyKmSJPpdguO6ZhsQlEIgYPngjJ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"419618","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"110274","synopsis":"The huge sandstorm disrupts Dao Ma's battle for revenge. But Ayuya decides to leave the group to seek her own personal revenge for her father.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4alIThJnhAp7mMCoQLFb8lbRUAZ.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"122508","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"44388","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"107463","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"419618","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"110285","synopsis":"Like the sandstorm she is, Ayuya turns back and kills two of her father's killers but gets outnumbered by the enemy soon. To save her and keep her master's wish, A Ni makes the ultimate sacrifice.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/poNUMQ2bnQ8xSNbbxrwyWDxaVE1.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16355","scope":"